export anchor DocumentaryMutedStyle:
    number: 362
    screen: VideoEditor
    name: Documentary muted
    idea: A quiet, desaturated editing page set like a documentary book, with a serif main column for picture and sequence, sources and settings as marginal notes, captions under every figure and the marker written as a footnote.
    base: dark
    palette:
        ash: #1b1a18, page, picture surround and the style sheet
        leaf: #22211e, swatch and control cells
        rule: #3a3833, section rules and the marginal rule
        segment: #2e2c29, clip segments
        selected: #3d3a35, the selected clip
        hairline: #6a665e, clip edges, the render line and text button underlines
        ink: #e6e1d8, text, the playhead and the dagger
        caption: #bdb6aa, captions and the dek
        stone: #a8a196, small caps labels, track roles and durations
        paper: #d9d2c4, the Export button, the only filled control
    type:
        A book serif stack, Iowan Old Style, Palatino Linotype, Palatino,
        Georgia, for text at 17px and 1.6. Labels are system sans in small
        caps, 13px tracked 0.2em for sections and 12px tracked 0.14em for
        plate labels. The headline is serif 48px regular, the picture title
        serif up to 34px, captions and clip names serif italic 15px and
        14px, prose 17px at 1.7.
    layout:
        A centred book page about 1120px wide with wide margins. The header
        sets Brightwork Cut as a small caps kicker, Launch teaser as a large
        serif headline, and an italic dek, A sequence in 1080p at 24 frames
        per second. On the right a hairline render line with Rendered 0
        percent and an italic Not started, over a pale paper Export, the
        only filled control. A hairline closes the header. The main column
        holds the picture desaturated on near black with a caption, Plate 1,
        The program at the timecode of the duration, holding on the title
        card, then text buttons Back, Play and Forward with thin chevrons
        and underlines. The sequence follows under a small caps label,
        tracks as hairline rows with the id in sans and the role in italic,
        clips as quiet blocks with a hairline left edge and italic names,
        the selected title card brighter with a 3px ink edge, underlined and
        marked selected. A dagger on the ruler at 84 drops a dotted line, a
        thin ink playhead with a dot reads 18 s, a Plate 2 caption describes
        the figure and a footnote reads the dagger and Marker, cut to logo,
        at 84 seconds. A marginal column behind a hairline holds Sources, a
        numbered list of the five files with durations, and On the title
        card, a prose sentence giving position 960 by 540, scale 100
        percent, opacity 100 percent and a cross dissolve of 12 frames in
        bold. At phone width the margin hides and track roles drop.
    spacing: Book margins. 56px around the page, 48px between sections, 56px gutter to the margin column.
    density: Low. One picture, one sequence and two short marginal notes.
    corners: 2px on Export only. Everything else is square or open.
    borders: Hairline rules, a single marginal rule and underlined text buttons.
    shadows: None.
    icons: Barely any. Thin chevrons and a play triangle beside words, a dagger for the marker and a dot on the playhead.
    focus: A 1px ink outline with a second hairline ring, offset 4px.
    tone: Captioned and literary, such as Plate 1, The sequence, On the title card and Not started.
